    h "Lo siento, esa es mía."

# game/Story04.rpy:4658

translate spanish story05_8_c3237d01:

    # k "That hit sealed it, we need to move."
    k "Ese golpe lo selló, tenemos que movernos."

# game/Story04.rpy:4659

translate spanish story05_8_c1bcff2e:

    # k "I’m afraid her little stunt aggroed pretty much everything with a pulse."
    k "Me temo que su pequeña agitación agitaba casi todo con pulso."

# game/Story04.rpy:4660

translate spanish story05_8_570c24b2:

    # mc "Interesting. Where exactly are we supposed to go? We’re cornered. Lora, doors?"
    mc "Interesante. ¿Dónde exactamente se supone que vamos? Estamos acorralados. Lora, puertas?"

# game/Story04.rpy:4661

translate spanish story05_8_b2698d79:

    # L "Sealed shut. They won’t open."
    L "Cerrados. No se abren."

# game/Story04.rpy:4663

